From a027245f62ea383046e517a07bdc709a2b900439 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:22:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Priorities: route adapter, PrioritiesPage and
 PrioritiesPageContext

The route shapes the matrix through toPrioritiesPageProps (the header's
week falls back to the current ISO week) and renders PrioritiesPage, which
absorbs PrioritiesScreen and provides PrioritiesPageContext. QuadrantCell,
MatrixTaskCard, MoveToPopover, MoveToRows and the mobile sheet take data
only; grouping and the tracked check move to groupTasksByQuadrant and
isTrackedTask in oneOffUtils, with unit tests. The Design Console renders
PrioritiesPage through the same adapter and wraps the matrix card specimen
and the sheet panel in inertPrioritiesPageContext.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KCt6pJqa8KhamA3TH91m92
